K00-FC7.backEn:
1) **Docker Desktop** (popular GUI on Windows/macOS);
2) **OrbStack** (ultra-lightweight, 2s startup, low RAM/battery on macOS);
3) **Podman** (daemonless & rootless by default on Linux).

K03-FC4.backEn:
1) ~8x smaller (~135MB vs ~1.1GB);
2) Much faster pulls in CI and Kubernetes;
3) Fewer extra packages, significantly reducing security vulnerabilities (CVEs).

K04-FC2.backEn:
1) Prevent secret leaks (`.env`, `*.pem`, `.git`);
2) Avoid copying OS-mismatched `node_modules` from the host;
3) Shrink the Build Context and keep Layer Cache stable.

K06-FC1.backEn:
1) Space-separated command: **`docker compose`** (not `docker-compose`);
2) Standard filename: **`compose.yaml`**;
3) **No `version:` key** at the top of the file.

K07-FC1.backEn:
1) **`kube-apiserver`** (central API gateway);
2) **`etcd`** (cluster state database);
3) **`kube-scheduler`** (assigns Pods to Nodes);
4) **`kube-controller-manager`** (runs reconciliation control loops).

K07-FC2.backEn:
1) **`kubelet`** (node agent managing Pods on the Node);
2) **Container Runtime** (`containerd`);
3) **`kube-proxy`** (network routing for Services).
